; OPTIONAL PATCH, do not copy over the controller's cell.src:
; its CASE list is cell-specific. Add the two lines below to the SWITCH PGNO block
; of KRC/R1/Folgen/cell.src (CASE 0 of SWITCH P_TYPE), keeping the existing cases.

SWITCH PGNO
   CASE 11
      FOLGE11()
ENDSWITCH

; Folge 11 must be 1..255: PRG_NR is 8 bits (E1-E8) on these robots.